~ start
match PlayerStats.scene_progress
	when 0
		Driver: Hello, this package is already paid for by the sender.
		Max: Thank you very much?
		do play_package()
		Max: Huh, a polaroid camera.
		Max: A note is attached to it... from my Tita Comafay.
		Max: "The best way to relive the past is to capture its image, yet the only way to capture its image is to beget the past"
		Max: ...Interesting. Tita didn't strike me as a poet?
		do PlayerStats.continue_scene()
		$> PlayerStats.has_cam = true
	when 2
		Max: Do I wanna go to Joshua's store already?
		- Yes
			do go_to_store() 
		- No
=> END